---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout 
  title="About Us - UTM Link Builder" 
  description="Learn about UTM Link Builder, the fast and free tool for marketers to create tracked URLs."
>
  <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto w-full px-6 prose prose-invert">
    <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold text-white mb-6">About Us</h1>
    <p>
      Welcome to <strong>UTM Link Builder</strong>, your number one source for clean, fast, and consistent marketing campaign tracking. We're dedicated to giving you the very best URL generation experience, with a focus on ease of use, data privacy, and consistency.
    </p>
    <p>
      Founded by digital marketing enthusiasts, our tool was built out of frustration with clunky spreadsheets and inconsistent UTM tagging. We wanted a tool that provided fast presets for popular platforms like TikTok, LinkedIn, and Facebook, ensuring that your Google Analytics data remains perfectly organized.
    </p>
    <p>
      This tool is 100% free to use. All link generation happens entirely within your browser, which means your campaign data is never saved, tracked, or stored on our servers. 
    </p>
    <p>
      If you have any questions or comments, please don't hesitate to contact us.
    </p>
  </div>
</Layout>
